      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING NICKEIL (5) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (30.25) in a Grade 5 at Nowra. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Can atone. RELEASE POINT (2) lines up chasing another win after getting around the 520m at this track in a good 29.82 on October 1. Harder here but expected to feature again. REGAL KADE (3) scored two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 6 length 5th at this track (30.51). Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. One of the main contenders. PARIS PARTY (1) scored from this box last start which puts her under notice.",
